 land after becoming \"tainted\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also a member of the mermaid family that Utsumi Hinowa enshrines in her home."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hinowa lives with her as her caretaker, and the two have become close friends, transcending race and status."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she enjoys her life on land, she especially cherishes the bonds of friendship she has formed with her newfound friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127527"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“穢れ”というものをうけて、陸上での生活を強いられることになった元人魚姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内海日輪の家で祀っている人魚の一族でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同居している世話役の内海日輪とは種族や身分を超え、自他ともに認める親友になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地上の生活を謳歌しつつ、初めてできた気の置けない友人達との友情を何より大切にしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24759","sourceWorkId":"34586","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"休み直前に龍宮村にやって来た転校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日輪の家に同居しており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本に来たばかりだからか、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも興味津々で突飛な言動がある少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生来の性格により早速村に馴染み、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏の龍宮村を満喫している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132491"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132491","value":"龍宮村・ご飯・友達"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132491","value":"しんみりした雰囲気"},{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132491","value":"2年生"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24759","sourceWorkId":"34586","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24759","sourceWorkId":"34586","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24759","sourceWorkId":"34586","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"